* pregnancy and any contraindication to the use of PEEP;
* such as increased work of breathing (acute asthma);
* active hemoptysis;
* acute sinusitis;
* pneumothorax;
* untreated; surgery or facial trauma;
* oral or injury;
* epistaxis;
* nausea and esophageal surgery.

Inclusion Criteria:

